ener\">Visit EAD Scientific</a><span>or contact Innovive at <a href=\"mailto:info@innovive.com\">info@innovive.com</a></span></div></div></div></details><details><summary><span>United Kingdom &amp; Ireland</span><span class=\"gp-tag\">Authorized partner</span></summary><div class=\"gp-body\"><div class=\"gp-logo\"><img src=\"https://innovive.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/datesand-group-logo-uniform.png\" alt=\"Datesand Group logo\" width=\"180\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"gp-info\"><p><strong>Datesand Group</strong> is Innovive's authorized partner for United Kingdom &amp; Ireland.</p><div class=\"gp-actions\"><a class=\"gp-btn\" href=\"https://www.datesand.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Visit Datesand Group</a><span>or contact Innovive at <a href=\"mailto:info@innovive.com\">info@innovive.com</a></span></div></div></div></details><details><summary><span>Middle East &amp; GCC</span><span class=\"gp-tag\">Authorized partner</span></summary><div class=\"gp-body\"><div class=\"gp-logo\"><img src=\"https://innovive.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/attentive-science-logo-uniform.png\" alt=\"Attentive Science logo\" width=\"180\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"gp-info\"><p><strong>Attentive Science</strong> is Innovive's authorized partner for GCC &amp; Middle East.</p><div class=\"gp-actions\"><a class=\"gp-btn\" href=\"https://www.attentivescience.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Visit Attentive Science</a><span>or contact Innovive at <a href=\"mailto:info@innovive.com\">info@innovive.com</a></span></div></div></div></details><details><summary><span>Japan</span><span class=\"gp-tag\">Authorized partner</span></summary><div class=\"gp-body\"><div class=\"gp-logo\"><img src=\"https://innovive.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/oriental-logo-uniform.png\" alt=\"Oriental Giken logo\" width=\"180\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"gp-info\"><p><strong>Oriental Giken</strong> is Innovive's authorized partner for Japan.</p><div class=\"gp-action